  "description": "AlterNET Code Editor is a .NET component library that brings efficient code editing functionality into your WinForms and WPF .NET applications. It provides code editing capabilities such as syntax highlighting, code completion and code outlining, visual indicators for bookmarks, line styles, syntax errors, and much more, matching the speed and convenience of the Microsoft Visual Studio/Visual Studio Code text editor.\n\nThis package includes a PowerShell parser based on the LangServer.org protocol, which provides features like auto-completion, go-to definition, finding all references, etc.\nThis parser includes LangServer executable and library files for PowerShell in the form of embedded resources.\n\nThis multi-target package can be used with .NET applications targeting .NET Framework starting from 4.6.2 or .NET 6 / .NET 7 / .NET 8\n\nMore information about Code Editor can be found here:\nhttps://www.alternetsoft.com/products/editor\n\nDocumentation and sample projects can be downloaded here:\nhttps://www.alternetsoft.com/download\n\nNOTE: This is a commercial software product and requires purchasing a license for legal usage. Please refer to our licensing FAQ here:\nhttps://www.alternetsoft.com/faq#license",
